OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested on terror charges
OL,4,Aafter pro-Palestinian Action rally
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been charged
OL,7,Ffollowing a pro-Palestinian Action
OL,8,Frally in Edinburgh.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland officers attended the
OL,11,Fevent at Regent Terrace on Saturday.
OL,13,FThe force confirmed two women and a man
OL,14,Fhave now been charged in connection
OL,15,Fwith terrorism offences relating to
OL,16,Fsupporting a proscribed organisation.
OL,18,FA spokesperson said a report would be
OL,19,Fsubmitted to the procurator fiscal.
